 79	   * which is every deployment. This is the provider seam: a test hands over a
 80	   * scripted implementation that answers deterministically from memory, so
 81	   * per-behavior fan-out, score normalization, and one failed call beside
 82	   * successful siblings are all asserted with no key and no network.
